    "detailed_description": "Welcome adventurer, to &quot;Rogue Resonance&quot;, an immersive 3D top-down action roguelike game that combines carefully crafted rooms with a procedurally-generated labyrinth, ready to challenge all who enter this realm.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engage in Intense Combat</h2>Get ready for thrilling melee hack-and-slash combat as you dash and unleash a diverse array of powerful spells. Face off against hordes of enemies and formidable foes whose fates are intricately woven into the very fabric of this world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850280/extras/483c5a0b60322695563901cb0f1c89c0.poster.avif?t=1736361712\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850280/extras/483c5a0b60322695563901cb0f1c89c0.webm?t=1736361712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850280/extras/483c5a0b60322695563901cb0f1c89c0.mp4?t=1736361712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Stronger with Each Encounter</h2>With every hard-fought triumph, you'll grow stronger. Harness the variety of offerings bestowed upon you by this realm to upgrade your melee attacks, enhance your dashing abilities, and unlock potent spells, each bestowed randomly or presented with a choice to strategically plan your arsenal.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850280/extras/8531c8de31948f03f994bbdd5b459f91.poster.avif?t=1736361712\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850280/extras/8531c8de31948f03f994bbdd5b459f91.webm?t=1736361712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850280/extras/8531c8de31948f03f994bbdd5b459f91.mp4?t=1736361712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover secrets and mysteries</h2>Prepare yourself, brave adventurer, for a journey of discovery and danger unlike any other. The fate of this world hangs in the balance, and only you can uncover its deepest secrets. But fear not, for even in defeat, the allure of adventure beckons anew.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850280/extras/2c978016ebda01ae00f5514fb3e06eba.poster.avif?t=1736361712\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850280/extras/2c978016ebda01ae00f5514fb3e06eba.webm?t=1736361712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850280/extras/2c978016ebda01ae00f5514fb3e06eba.mp4?t=1736361712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Will you emerge victorious, or will the depths of the labyrinth claim you? There's only one way to find out. Dive into the ever-shifting rooms of &quot;Rogue Resonance&quot; and let\u2019s resonate higher and higher.",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome adventurer, to &quot;Rogue Resonance&quot;, an immersive 3D top-down action roguelike game that combines carefully crafted rooms with a procedurally-generated labyrinth, ready to challenge all who enter this realm.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engage in Intense Combat</h2>Get ready for thrilling melee hack-and-slash combat as you dash and unleash a diverse array of powerful spells. Face off against hordes of enemies and formidable foes whose fates are intricately woven into the very fabric of this world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850280/extras/483c5a0b60322695563901cb0f1c89c0.poster.avif?t=1736361712\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850280/extras/483c5a0b60322695563901cb0f1c89c0.webm?t=1736361712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850280/extras/483c5a0b60322695563901cb0f1c89c0.mp4?t=1736361712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Stronger with Each Encounter</h2>With every hard-fought triumph, you'll grow stronger. Harness the variety of offerings bestowed upon you by this realm to upgrade your melee attacks, enhance your dashing abilities, and unlock potent spells, each bestowed randomly or presented with a choice to strategically plan your arsenal.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850280/extras/8531c8de31948f03f994bbdd5b459f91.poster.avif?t=1736361712\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850280/extras/8531c8de31948f03f994bbdd5b459f91.webm?t=1736361712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850280/extras/8531c8de31948f03f994bbdd5b459f91.mp4?t=1736361712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover secrets and mysteries</h2>Prepare yourself, brave adventurer, for a journey of discovery and danger unlike any other. The fate of this world hangs in the balance, and only you can uncover its deepest secrets. But fear not, for even in defeat, the allure of adventure beckons anew.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850280/extras/2c978016ebda01ae00f5514fb3e06eba.poster.avif?t=1736361712\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850280/extras/2c978016ebda01ae00f5514fb3e06eba.webm?t=1736361712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850280/extras/2c978016ebda01ae00f5514fb3e06eba.mp4?t=1736361712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Will you emerge victorious, or will the depths of the labyrinth claim you? There's only one way to find out. Dive into the ever-shifting rooms of &quot;Rogue Resonance&quot; and let\u2019s resonate higher and higher.",
